&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;语法不太懂，但是逻辑比较简单。先编译，切换环境为 Injected Provider - MetaMask (直接在 Remix 的默认环境（Remix VM）相当于在本地测试)，然后把合约地址填入，点at address&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://hataovo.github.io/p/blockchain%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-%E4%B8%80/1.png"
width="1115"
height="682"
srcset="https://hataovo.github.io/p/blockchain%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-%E4%B8%80/1_hu_1ead710a6970e8c7.png 480w, https://hataovo.github.io/p/blockchain%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-%E4%B8%80/1_hu_911092bed9c950c6.png 1024w"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
