&lt;p&gt;在 metamask 中把网络切到 Sepolia 测试网&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://hataovo.github.io/p/blockchain%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-%E4%B8%80/2.png"
width="384"
height="277"
srcset="https://hataovo.github.io/p/blockchain%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-%E4%B8%80/2_hu_e7c2ed287851e471.png 480w, https://hataovo.github.io/p/blockchain%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-%E4%B8%80/2_hu_17792a5c437db74d.png 1024w"
